cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Instantiating the Knowledge Plane
message: >-
  If you use this software or its experimental data, please cite the
  accompanying paper.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/fchamicapereira/agentic-networks
url: https://fchamicapereira.github.io/agentic-networks/
abstract: >-
  An emulated interdomain network in which LLM agents act as autonomous system
  administrators, one per network entity, collaborating across organizational
  boundaries to diagnose faults, reason about misleading routing announcements,
  and make policy-driven routing decisions. Includes the emulation harness, agent
  prompts, topologies, and complete logs for every experiment in the paper.
keywords:
  - knowledge plane
  - interdomain routing
  - network management
  - large language models
  - multi-agent systems
